# 1. Standard Accounting Pages Redirects (Old Google Sites -> New SPA Sections)
# Redirecting old indexed paths with a 301 Permanent Redirect to clean homepage anchor sections
/tax-preparation      /#services     301
/corporate-finance    /#services     301
/contact-us           /#contact      301
/contact              /#contact      301

# 2. SPA Rewrite Rule
# Forces Netlify to serve index.html for any deep URLs, allowing client-side routing to handle them
/*                    /index.html    200

# 3. Catch-all Redirect for any lingering broken links from old indexation
# (Optional) If you are not using client-side sub-routes and want unmatched requests to go directly 
# to the homepage as a 301, uncomment the line below:
# /*                  /              301!
